{"headword":"מָאֵן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. Pi. refuse (Qal</strong> perhaps <em>be distasteful</em>, cf. Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܶܐܢ</span> <em>taeduit, piguit</em>, Aph. <em>be slothful;</em> NH Pi., as term. techn. of girl, <em>refuse</em> to acknowledge marriage contract; poss. akin to Ethiopic መነነ <em>reject;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَأَنَ</span> is <em>sustain, maintain</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:14\" href=\"/Exodus.7.14\">Ex 7:14</a> + 4 times; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֲנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.18\">Je 15:18</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאַנְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:3\" href=\"/Exodus.10.3\">Ex 10:3</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמָאֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:16\" href=\"/Exodus.22.16\">Ex 22:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמָאֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:35\" href=\"/Genesis.37.35\">Gn 37:35</a> + 8 times etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָאֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:16\" href=\"/Exodus.22.16\">Ex 22:16</a>;—<em>refuse</em>, (sq. ל with inf. except 6 times) human subj. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:35\" href=\"/Genesis.37.35\">Gn 37:35</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.15\">Je 31:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:16\" href=\"/Exodus.22.16\">Ex 22:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:21\" href=\"/Numbers.20.21\">Nu 20:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:14\" href=\"/Numbers.22.14\">22:14</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.7\">Dt 25:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.19\">1 S 8:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.23\">2 S 2:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.9\">13:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:35\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.35\">1 K 20:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.15\">21:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:12\" href=\"/Esther.1.12\">Est 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.33\">Je 50:33</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 6:7\" href=\"/Job.6.7\">Jb 6:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:3\" href=\"/Psalms.77.3\">ψ 77:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.25\">Pr 21:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.18\">Je 15:18</a>; without Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמָאֵן וַיֹּאמֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:8\" href=\"/Genesis.39.8\">Gn 39:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:19\" href=\"/Genesis.48.19\">48:19</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.23\">1 S 28:23</a>; also <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.16\">2 K 5:16</a>; especially of refusing to obey <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s commands <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:23\" href=\"/Exodus.4.23\">Ex 4:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:14\" href=\"/Exodus.7.14\">7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:3\" href=\"/Exodus.10.3\">10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:28\" href=\"/Exodus.16.28\">16:28</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.17\">Ne 9:17</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:10\" href=\"/Psalms.78.10\">ψ 78:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.7\">Pr 21:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:5\" href=\"/Hosea.11.5\">Ho 11:5</a>, v. especially <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.3\">5:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.5\">8:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.5\">9:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.10\">11:10</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.28\">25:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.11\">Zc 7:11</a>; without Inf. = <em>be recusant</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.24\">Pr 1:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.20\">Is 1:20</a>; once subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:13\" href=\"/Numbers.22.13\">Nu 22:13</a> (E)."}],"form":"Pi."}]},"rid":"BDB05023","strong_numbers":["3985","3986"],"next_hw":"מָאֵן²","prev_hw":"מַאֲמָר²","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4412","4413"],"TWOT":["1138","1138a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}